  "job_B3.2.10_20251003_114611": {
    "text": "DOMINICA PRIMA IN QUADRAGESIMA.\nMen \u00fea leofestan, her saga\u00fe Matheus se godspellere \u00fe\u00e6tte se H\u00e6lend w\u00e6re l\u00e6ded on westen, & \u00fe\u00e6t he\nSe costigend \u00fea eode to him, & him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, Gif \u00feu sie Godes sunu, cwe\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea stanas to hlafum\nSe H\u00e6lend him \u00fea ondswarode, & him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, Ne bi\u00f0 on hlafe anum mannes lif, ac of eallum \u00fe\u00e6m\n\u00dea genam hine se awyrgda gast & he hine l\u00e6dde on \u00fea halgan ceastre, & he hine asette ofer \u00fe\u00e6s temples\nH\u00e6lend him \u00fea eft ondswarode & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Ne costa \u00feu \u00feinne Drihten God.\n\u00de\u00e6t deofol hine \u00fea genam \u00feriddan si\u00fee, and he hine l\u00e6dde upon swi\u00fee hea dune, & him \u00e6teowde eal\nH\u00e6lend him ondswerede & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Ga \u00feu onb\u00e6cling, wi\u00feerwearda; for\u00feon \u00fee awriten is, Weor\u00fea \u00feinne\nHine \u00fea forlet se costigend, and his englas him toeodan & him \u00feegnedan.\nMen \u00fea leofestan, cu\u00fe is \u00fe\u00e6tte hra\u00fee Drihten, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he of \u00feam fulwihtes b\u00e6\u00fee eode, \u00fea f\u00e6stte he sona,\n& hie sweotollice cy\u00fedon \u00fe\u00e6t se egeslica domes d\u00e6g cyme\u00fe on \u00fea tid \u00fee Godes sunu on rode galgan\nAc \u00fe\u00e6t us is to ge\u00feencenne, \u00fe\u00e6t ure Drihten \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m fulwihte f\u00e6stte, & eac w\u00e6s costad.\nUs is \u00feonne ned\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we f\u00e6ston; for\u00feon \u00fee we beo\u00f0 oft costode from deofle \u00e6fter urum fulwihte.\nDrihten us manode mid his f\u00e6stenne, & mid eallum his d\u00e6dum, \u00fe\u00e6t we sceolan him \u00feeowian, & deofol\nUs is \u00feonne mid mycelre gemynde to ge\u00feencenne \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00e6lmihtiga, se \u00fee w\u00e6s on Godes hiwe, God\nGe\u00feencean we eac, gif o\u00feer nyten w\u00e6re to haligienne, & geteod to \u00feon ecan life, \u00feonne onfenge he\nFor\u00feon eal swa hw\u00e6t swa we to gode do\u00fe on mildheortnesse, o\u00fe\u00fee on eadmodnesse, o\u00fe\u00fee on elne\nHw\u00e6t we gehyrdon \u00fe\u00e6t se godspellere cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t se H\u00e6lend w\u00e6re gel\u00e6ded on westen, & \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re\nUs is to gelyfenne \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feyder come, n\u00e6s no geneded, ne under\u00feeoded, ac mid his wyllan; & for\u00feon\nRihtlic \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t he eode on westen \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6r Adam forwear\u00fe.\nFor \u00ferim \u00feingum H\u00e6lend eode on westen; for\u00feon \u00fee he wolde deofol gela\u00feian to campe wi\u00fe hine, &\nMid \u00ferim gemettum seo costung, \u00fe\u00e6t ane cw\u00e6\u00fe, Do\u00f0 swa swa ic inc bebeode, \u00feonne beo gyt swa swa\nNu he \u00feonne costode Godes Sunu \u00feurh idel wuldor, \u00f0a he cw\u00e6\u00fe, Gif \u00feu sy Godes Sunu, send \u00fee ny\u00feer.\nHalige men \u00feonne ongeaton \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s so\u00fe Godes Sunu; for\u00feon \u00fee God F\u00e6der stemn w\u00e6s gehyred \u00e6t\n\u00deonne is cu\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t se awergda gast ongan Godes bec trahtian, & \u00fea sona leah; for\u00feon \u00feis n\u00e6s gecweden\nSe H\u00e6lend him tocw\u00e6\u00fe, Ne costa \u00feu \u00feinne Drihten God.\nN\u00e6s his gemet \u00fe\u00e6t he hine costode, eode swa \u00feeah on \u00fea frecenesse, & wolde gecunnian hwe\u00feer he\nHe cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00feas ealle ic \u00fee sylle, gif \u00feu feallest to me, and me weor\u00feast.\nEala so\u00felice se afealle\u00fe se \u00fee deofol weor\u00fee\u00fe.\nHit is to gelyfenne \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten mihte on anre tide d\u00e6ges geseon ealles \u00feysses middangeardes\nAc se forhwyrfda gast spr\u00e6c forhwyrfedlice word, \u00fea he wolde \u00fe\u00e6m hean cininge & \u00fe\u00e6m heofonlican\nAh \u00fe\u00e6t manfulle wuht wolde \u00fe\u00e6t he hine weor\u00feode se \u00fee stige\u00fe ofer \u00fea \u00ferymsetl heofona rices, and his\nSwa we sceolan hine mid wordum weor\u00feian, & him on d\u00e6dum \u00feeowian.\nHe cw\u00e6\u00fe, Ga \u00feu onb\u00e6cling, & gemyne \u00fee sylfne hu mycel yfel \u00fee gelamp for \u00feinre gitsunga &\n\u00deas cy\u00fenesse Drihten nam of \u00feisse wisan.\nWel geheowede Dauid \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fea he wolde wi\u00fe Golia\u00fe gefeohtan, \u00fea nam he fif stanas on his herdebelig,\nUs is \u00feonne to ge\u00feencenne \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00feas d\u00e6da \u00feus gedone from Drihtne mid ealre \u00feoncunga & m\u00e6rsunga\nSe ilca Sunu w\u00e6s \u00e6r eallum tidum acenned fram God F\u00e6der, se \u00e6lmihtiga from \u00feon \u00e6lmihtigan, & se\nFor\u00feon his miht bi\u00f0 a ece, his rice ne bi\u00f0 gewemmed.\nSwa se witga be \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00fe, Man bi\u00f0 acenned of Iudan, and he wealde\u00fe eallum \u00feeodum: & for\u00feon ealra\nFor\u00f0on hine m\u00e6g nu \u00e6lc mon oforswi\u00fean, & he n\u00e6nige mehte wi\u00f0 us nafa\u00fe, buton hwylc man \u00feurh \u00f0a\n\u00deurh Cristes sige ealle halige w\u00e6ron gefreolsode, \u00fea \u00fee him \u00feeowia\u00fe on rihtwisnesse & on halignesse;\nHw\u00e6t we gehyrdon \u00fe\u00e6t se godspellere cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t H\u00e6lend w\u00e6re l\u00e6ded from deofle on \u00fea halgan\n\u00deonne \u00feinc\u00fe \u00feis geleaffullum mannum swi\u00fee andrysnlicu wise to gehyrenne; ac gif we asmeaga\u00fe \u00fea\nCu\u00fe is \u00fe\u00e6t se awyrgda gast is heafod ealra unrihtwisra d\u00e6da, swylce unrihtwise syndon deofles\nFor\u00feon nis \u00fe\u00e6t nan wundor \u00feeah se hea Cyning & se eca Drihten hine sylfne let l\u00e6don on \u00fea hean\nNis \u00fe\u00e6t to wundrigenne \u00feeah \u00fee he w\u00e6re costod, se to \u00feon com \u00fe\u00e6t he acweald beon wolde; for\u00feon he\nDrihten w\u00e6s gelichomod on hrife \u00fe\u00e6re a cl\u00e6nan f\u00e6mnan, & buton synnum he cwom on middangeard,\nAc us is to smeagenne \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten on \u00fe\u00e6re costunge nolde his \u00fea myclan miht gecy\u00fean, se \u00fee mihte\nAc mid \u00feon worde \u00fe\u00e6s godcundan gewrites he hine oforswi\u00fede.\nMid his ge\u00feylde he us bysene onstealde, \u00fe\u00e6t swa oft swa we oht unea\u00fees \u00ferowian \u00e6t yfflum monnum,\nUs is eac to ge\u00feencenne hu mycel Godes ge\u00feyld is, & hu mycel ure unge\u00feyld is; & gif us hwa abylg\u00fe,\nEala hw\u00e6t Drihten deofles costunga ge\u00feyldelice ab\u00e6r.\nNolde he him na andswerian buton mid mon\u00few\u00e6rnesse, se \u00fee mihte hine sona on helle gewitnian; ac\nAc on \u00fe\u00e6m w\u00e6s gecy\u00feed \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s on anum hade twegra gecynda; he w\u00e6s so\u00fe man, \u00fey hine dorste\nWe magon ongytan on \u00fe\u00e6m ure tydran gecynd, gif \u00fe\u00e6t deofol hine ne gesawe on ure gecynde, ne\nWeor\u00feian we for\u00feon Drihtnes godcundnesse, gif he n\u00e6re so\u00fe God ofer ealle gesceafta, na him englas\nOn \u00feisse bysene is gecy\u00feed \u00fe\u00e6t eallum geleaffullum mannum englas \u00feegnia\u00fe, \u00feonne hi habba\u00fe deofol\nHw\u00e6t we gehyrdon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t fasten \u00feyses feowertiges daga ongunnen w\u00e6s instepes \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he of \u00fe\u00e6m\nRiht \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t ealle geleaffulle men \u00feis feowertig daga on forh\u00e6fdnesse lifgean, & eac us is to\nSwa we eac agylta\u00fe \u00feurh feower \u00feing, \u00feurh ge\u00feoht, & \u00feurh word, & \u00feurh weroc, & \u00feurh willan;\nHw\u00e6t we gehyrdon nu \u00fe\u00e6t we sceolan under \u00fe\u00e6m feowerteo\u00fean gerime, swa swa geara beboden w\u00e6s\nGeare we witon \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00fe\u00e6m geare bi\u00f0 \u00fereo hund daga & fif & syxtig daga; gif we \u00feonne on \u00fe\u00e6m syx\n& gif we \u00fea dagas fulfremedlice for Gode lifgea\u00fe, \u00feonne h\u00e6bbe we ure daga \u00feone teo\u00fean d\u00e6l for\n& ge\u00feencean we \u00fe\u00e6t we ealne \u00feysne gear lifdon mid ures lichoman willan.\nNu is \u00feearf mycel \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00feone teo\u00fean d\u00e6l for Gode gedon, & on forh\u00e6fdnesse lifian, & ure synna\n\u00deas dagas \u00feyses feowertiges nihta tacna\u00fe \u00feas ondweardan weorld, & \u00fea Easterlican dagas tacnia\u00fe \u00fea\n& swa we nu on maran forh\u00e6fdnesse lifia\u00fe \u00feas dagas, & on andrysnum \u00feingum beo\u00fe on \u00feysse worlde,\nDon we urum Drihtne so\u00fee hreowe & bote, \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t gegearnian ura synna forl\u00e6tnesse, & ece\nGe\u00feencean we geornlice \u00fe\u00e6t we us healdan on \u00feas tid, & on \u00e6lce, wi\u00fe \u00fea heafodlican leahtras; for\u00feon\n\u00deonne sceolon we nu for \u00feon d\u00e6ghwamlicum synnum on \u00feas tid georne cl\u00e6nsian, mid f\u00e6stenne, &\nSwa we sceolon eac ure heortan gefyllan mid \u00fe\u00e6re swetnesse godcundra beboda, \u00fe\u00e6t on us ne sy\nNe magon we buton \u00fe\u00e6m medmyclum synnum beon, ah we sceolan on \u00feas tid \u00feas feawan dagas on\nFor\u00f0on seo blis & seo oferfyll \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman getyh\u00fe \u00feone mon to synnum, & seo forh\u00e6fdnes hine\nNe gelyfe \u00fe\u00e6s n\u00e6nig mon \u00fe\u00e6t him ne genihtsumige \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten to ecere h\u00e6lo, buton he mid o\u00ferum\nBe \u00fe\u00e6m Esaias se witga cw\u00e6\u00fe, Brec \u00feinne hlaf \u00feearfendum mannum, & sona swa \u00feu geseo nacodne\nHw\u00e6t we gehyrdon \u00fe\u00e6t Gode bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten swy\u00fee gecweme, gif se mon ahef\u00fe his handa to\nSe mildheorta Drihten, ure Scyppend, onfeh\u00fe swi\u00fee lustfullice eallum \u00fe\u00e6m godum \u00fee \u00e6nig man gede\u00fe\n& swa hwylc man swa mid godum willan f\u00e6stan m\u00e6ge, & o\u00feres d\u00e6ges metes his lichoman ofteon,\nBe \u00fe\u00e6m Iohel se witga cw\u00e6\u00fe, Halgia\u00fe eower f\u00e6sten, & medeme lac bringa\u00fe Drihtne, \u00fe\u00e6t is, ures\nNe magon \u00feis \u00feeah ealle men don; ac hit sceolan don \u00fea \u00fee God \u00feas world to forl\u00e6ten h\u00e6f\u00fe; & for\u00feon\n\u00deonne is nu to ge\u00feencenne on \u00feas halgan tid, nu we urne lichoman cl\u00e6nsia\u00fe mid f\u00e6stenum & mid\n& symle bli\u00fee mode Godes beboda utan we behealdan, \u00feonne gel\u00e6de\u00fe he us on \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif, \u00fe\u00e6r we\nAmen.",
